<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-18T14:22:43.561Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 14:22:43 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Bandits continue to launch lethal attacks on civilians in Plateau and Zamfara, killing residents and abducting worshippers, while police operations in Benue have killed three suspected bandits and arrested ten kidnap suspects. The Nigerian army seized a suspected bandits' ammunition supplier hiding 300 bullets in a sack of beans, and bandits abducted nine people and injured residents in Kaduna. Political figures are being targeted, with a police arrest of 78 Muslim youths over an attack on President Tinubu and a question from Obi about repeated killings in Plateau. The conflict recorded 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxNRVg0aXlnWTRHdk81aU1LbThMMktiemtaa0hfRnk4bFdlZWs5aUVYVjlhMGVXVjZQOXNraWNRTGFGMTNFTlJ3aVFwWGUzREphRDRnNlljVE5xZmFkSlVrMDVSOTZ0V2R1VzNfSTNtcU91eEhNeU5teDVuM2JBLVFCaHppNA?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxOT1hsV2NYVlZtMi1yMWxveHNmOEF4U2dUbDRHWnFGSDd1UlVrdmdnTUt1b18ydTlFWjdZQk9xOGdGVTh4Q20wQWpOSl9maXhXSFhvazhZYi05Sy13RXZhMnJYQVl2VTIxeVlVX0dGMldKMVFPUmhyWUJRNDhpbVpTQVJaX3FndXdLWWdBaU9UbDg5eDB3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Trust&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxPaE5oTWpwd25weW1wZS1VNEVHaXdoWVZQYVhhY0dZRDA0Vk9lZHBzR2xXWi1TUWxjVnhWNS1ZV2tncVhxa0dmUkJhOG1TM1VCaUZacmpKV1pkdTBfNmdON0ZsNkNiTFQ2WlN5Uk80ZFpPVEotM2NkNmtrWm84ZV9FWGRpLXdya2xON3NXZUVsSWc1c2U4cVVmLW9QOS1yYVpIRFMySE5adUsxUkNtR0RXNHJRYWFHWkpWUmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sahara Reporters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidkFVX3lxTE11ZWNNdEF3dUk3QkZ2YW9ZS1A2MUxnMjU4N3ptQVVhVzlKTmhJTTZuYzdOalhFZWFMMVdqVVUwYmlCMThWd3pKOEZoa0RWZHJpcFZObUQyLU42alAyN1czZTBYYlM5dUlFUDVDYUVFLVZhcVVaYnc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Idoma Voice Newspap